<title>INDIA: Hind. Lever 1997 first half net sales up.</title>
<headline>Hind. Lever 1997 first half net sales up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Hindustan Lever Ltd on Tuesday said its net sales had risen to 38.91 billion rupees in the first half of calendar 1997, as compared to 32.76 billion rupees in the corresponding period the previous year.</p>
<p>Hindustan Lever is the Indian subsidiary of Anglo-Dutch conglomerate Unilever.</p>
<p>--  Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
